[asy]
unitsize(0.5 cm);

pair A, B, C, D;

A = (2,6);
B = (0,0);
C = (5,0);
D = (2,0);

draw(A--B--C--cycle);
draw(A--D);

label("$A$", A, N);
label("$B$", B, SW);
label("$C$", C, SE);
label("$D$", D, S);
label("$2$", (B + D)/2, S, red);
label("$3$", (C + D)/2, S, red);
label("$x$", (A + D)/2, E, red);
[/asy]

Then $\tan \angle BAD = \frac{2}{x}$ and $\tan \angle CAD = \frac{3}{x}.$

